In the complex plane, the sets
$$
\begin{array}{l}
A=\left\{z \in \mathbf{C} \mid z^{3}-8=0\right\}, \\
B=\left\{z \in \mathbf{C} \mid z^{3}-8 z^{2}-8 z+64=0\right\}
\end{array}
$$
are given. Calculate the maximum distance between points in sets $A$ and $B$ in the complex plane.

